WEBVTT

00:00:02.830 --> 00:00:08.090
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:36.570
On our day off to go fishing,

00:01:36.920 --> 00:01:38.900
we ran into

00:01:38.950 --> 00:01:40.240
Dim Sum Chef Xie

00:01:40.370 --> 00:01:41.660
and had so much fun together

00:01:42.470 --> 00:01:43.300
while Dark Cooking Society

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:44.680
was already lurking

00:01:44.770 --> 00:01:46.230
around us

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.990
as Li Yan had said.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:55.600
Cooking tools mean the world to chefs.

00:01:56.030 --> 00:01:57.230
Your shumai is crap

00:01:57.780 --> 00:01:59.920
without the steel staff.

00:02:00.380 --> 00:02:01.450
You... you’re with

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:03.150
Dark Cooking Society?

00:02:05.180 --> 00:02:06.430
Underworld Hitman

00:02:07.150 --> 00:02:09.030
Cold-Hearted Genius Lei En

00:02:34.910 --> 00:02:35.520
Done!

00:02:36.260 --> 00:02:37.140
Unbelievable!

00:02:37.720 --> 00:02:39.160
That was quick!

00:02:39.360 --> 00:02:42.370
He did it faster than Chef Zhou Yu!

00:02:42.500 --> 00:02:44.900
And it’s impeccable.

00:02:44.950 --> 00:02:46.480
Some knife work he got!

00:02:46.760 --> 00:02:48.300
Visually, it’s impressive!

00:02:50.580 --> 00:02:51.770
This is a snap

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.550
for Mao.

00:02:53.600 --> 00:02:54.970
It’s nothing, really.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:02:59.810
That’s a handy knife.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.520
Was it your mother’s?

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:04.770
She used it every day

00:03:04.970 --> 00:03:07.180
back in Sichuan.

00:03:07.480 --> 00:03:09.210
May I take a look?

00:03:09.370 --> 00:03:09.820
Sure.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:10.460
Here you are.

00:03:13.400 --> 00:03:15.540
I like how it feels.

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.170
That shows

00:03:17.170 --> 00:03:18.500
the knife must’ve been used every day.

00:03:19.210 --> 00:03:20.840
So should every kitchen tool,

00:03:20.930 --> 00:03:22.570
my steel staff included.

00:03:22.630 --> 00:03:24.070
It’s someone else’s now.

00:03:24.120 --> 00:03:25.330
You lost it.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:26.260
That’s my steel staff!

00:03:26.330 --> 00:03:27.440
What are you talking about?

00:03:28.150 --> 00:03:30.520
Watch your mouth!

00:03:32.060 --> 00:03:33.360
You guys look busy.

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:34.790
Chef Ruoh.

00:03:36.380 --> 00:03:37.440
Listen,

00:03:37.670 --> 00:03:40.530
I need you to process something

00:03:40.970 --> 00:03:43.320
for a special guest we have today.

00:03:43.370 --> 00:03:43.780
Sure.

00:03:44.470 --> 00:03:45.970
What special guest?

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:48.880
Why didn’t father say anything about it?

00:03:50.320 --> 00:03:52.720
Who is it? How special?

00:03:58.510 --> 00:04:01.140
What a huge buffalo!

00:04:01.180 --> 00:04:02.970
I’ve never seen anything like this before.

00:04:03.070 --> 00:04:04.550
Such a big buffalo

00:04:04.660 --> 00:04:06.520
could only be seen
at Yang Spring Restaurant.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:08.360
This will be the main course

00:04:08.770 --> 00:04:11.340
for our guest tonight.

00:04:12.010 --> 00:04:13.650
Buffalo

00:04:13.930 --> 00:04:15.910
is Yang Spring Restaurant’s special.

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.000
What kind of guest is it?

00:04:19.650 --> 00:04:21.520
I’ll entrust you with the preparation.

00:04:23.170 --> 00:04:23.800
Yes, Chef.

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:25.030
I’ll get it done.

00:04:26.320 --> 00:04:29.240
Alright. Let’s make the best buffalo dish!

00:04:30.120 --> 00:04:32.040
Butcher it now, Mao.

00:04:32.220 --> 00:04:32.920
Sure.

00:04:33.590 --> 00:04:34.030
Here you are.

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:35.200
Thanks.

00:04:35.230 --> 00:04:37.900
Meili, where’s Zhou Yu?

00:04:38.430 --> 00:04:40.780
My father went to the market.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:41.980
I see.

00:04:42.340 --> 00:04:44.580
I'm going there, too.

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:51.050
Silang, be careful with the guts.

00:04:51.230 --> 00:04:52.520
Don’t damage them.

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:54.030
Meili,

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.080
don’t break the fiber.

00:04:56.310 --> 00:04:56.840
Got it.

00:04:58.300 --> 00:04:59.230
I’d join you

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:00.970
if I had my staff.

00:05:02.010 --> 00:05:03.100
A buffalo yea big

00:05:03.710 --> 00:05:05.600
is hard to cut through!

00:05:06.210 --> 00:05:07.040
I know.

00:05:27.890 --> 00:05:28.520
Who is it?

00:05:28.650 --> 00:05:29.680
What is he here for?

00:05:29.830 --> 00:05:30.960
Do you know him?

00:05:43.740 --> 00:05:45.600
Is he...?

00:05:46.110 --> 00:05:47.390
Rest in peace.

00:05:57.800 --> 00:05:59.310
He turned this huge buffalo

00:05:59.420 --> 00:06:01.500
into several cuts in a snap!

00:06:01.590 --> 00:06:05.000
That’s amazing! He did it flawlessly!

00:06:05.950 --> 00:06:07.360
Fast and precise

00:06:07.770 --> 00:06:08.680
without damaging any fiber.

00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.560
Who is he?

00:06:10.940 --> 00:06:12.170
Who on earth is this man?

00:06:12.650 --> 00:06:13.620
He’s really something!

00:06:13.780 --> 00:06:16.140
No way! It can’t be him...

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.660
He wielded such a big knife

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:22.520
without leaving a single drop of blood

00:06:23.060 --> 00:06:25.710
on the ground.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.080
Who exactly is he?

00:06:30.390 --> 00:06:31.390
I’ve finally seen it for real.

00:06:32.780 --> 00:06:34.000
Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop.

00:06:34.050 --> 00:06:35.970
(Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop)

00:06:35.970 --> 00:06:40.060
Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop

00:06:40.290 --> 00:06:41.880
cut the huge buffalo open

00:06:42.380 --> 00:06:43.270
like a flash

00:06:43.480 --> 00:06:45.120
without dripping any blood or juice.

00:06:46.630 --> 00:06:48.340
But that skill is only known

00:06:48.790 --> 00:06:49.920
by members of Dark Cooking Society.

00:06:50.310 --> 00:06:51.200
Dark...

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:52.980
Dark...

00:06:54.350 --> 00:06:55.930
If that skill is limited
within that circle

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:57.900
how did Mao

00:06:57.950 --> 00:06:59.170
get to know it?

00:07:00.740 --> 00:07:02.550
Where’s Ruoh and Zhou Yu?

00:07:03.340 --> 00:07:04.380
Who do you think you are?

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:05.990
How dare you call them by their names!

00:07:06.070 --> 00:07:06.560
That’s right!

00:07:06.610 --> 00:07:07.910
Show some respect!

00:07:13.650 --> 00:07:15.140
I knew it. It was you!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:16.720
You took my steel staff!

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:19.150
Chef Xie!

00:07:19.700 --> 00:07:20.500
Ouch!

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:22.190
That punk

00:07:22.450 --> 00:07:24.150
hit me hard!

00:07:24.810 --> 00:07:25.980
My hand got dirty.

00:07:26.680 --> 00:07:28.040
Drop the act!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:31.550
I don’t think we’ve met before.

00:07:31.850 --> 00:07:32.740
What did you say?

00:07:32.780 --> 00:07:33.850
Calm down, Chef Xie!

00:07:33.920 --> 00:07:35.020
Move, Mao!

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:37.170
A punch in his face

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:38.590
will help jog his memory!

00:07:38.640 --> 00:07:39.640
Don’t do it!

00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:42.160
Or Zhou Yu won’t be easy on you!

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:45.540
(Super)

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:52.370
So was it you?

00:07:54.130 --> 00:07:56.070
The Super Chef

00:07:56.130 --> 00:07:57.220
who defeated the Masked Chef, Li Yan?

00:07:59.060 --> 00:07:59.580
That’s right.

00:08:01.300 --> 00:08:02.300
Watch it!

00:08:02.400 --> 00:08:03.570
Dark Cooking Society

00:08:03.620 --> 00:08:04.830
must’ve sent him to harm you.

00:08:05.080 --> 00:08:06.190
Dark Cooking Society?

00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.490
So it’s true that Chef Zhou Yu and Mao

00:08:09.790 --> 00:08:10.880
are their targets.

00:08:11.090 --> 00:08:13.510
No! It can’t be!

00:08:15.860 --> 00:08:17.460
If it’s hard enough

00:08:17.510 --> 00:08:18.710
for you to process that buffalo,

00:08:18.980 --> 00:08:20.100
you aren’t as good as I thought.

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:21.620
What?

00:08:22.370 --> 00:08:23.180
Hey,

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:25.470
I don’t care who you are,

00:08:25.720 --> 00:08:26.600
but do you know

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.980
who you’re talking to?

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:30.000
That’s right!

00:08:30.330 --> 00:08:31.770
What do you want?

00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:32.510
Get out!

00:08:32.590 --> 00:08:34.750
You villains are unwelcome here!

00:08:35.030 --> 00:08:36.470
Yes! Get lost!

00:08:36.550 --> 00:08:38.100
Go! Now!

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.780
Calm down, guys.

00:08:40.010 --> 00:08:41.440
Teach him a lesson!

00:08:41.550 --> 00:08:42.850
Stop!

00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:49.230
Don’t you get it?

00:08:50.060 --> 00:08:51.660
He’s Lei En!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:53.030
Lei En?

00:08:53.330 --> 00:08:54.490
Lei En? That Lei En?

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:55.710
No way!

00:08:56.230 --> 00:08:57.570
I recognized him

00:08:58.420 --> 00:08:59.630
because he lived with us before.

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.780
Really?

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:03.440
I don’t believe this.

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:04.700
Sister,

00:09:04.940 --> 00:09:06.750
who the heck is Lei En?

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:07.640
Meili,

00:09:08.330 --> 00:09:09.470
can you tell me about him?

00:09:10.220 --> 00:09:11.130
Lei En was as talented

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.690
as Mao

00:09:12.820 --> 00:09:14.060
when he was young.

00:09:14.110 --> 00:09:15.590
We were so proud of him.

00:09:19.410 --> 00:09:20.080
After a week

00:09:20.760 --> 00:09:22.510
of being trained here,

00:09:22.620 --> 00:09:23.570
he could plate

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.560
cold dishes.

00:09:26.120 --> 00:09:27.110
And a month later,

00:09:27.380 --> 00:09:28.380
he mastered

00:09:28.430 --> 00:09:31.080
over half of my father’s signature dishes.

00:09:31.780 --> 00:09:34.840
Even Chef Ruoh spoke highly of him

00:09:34.880 --> 00:09:36.340
and called him a future master chef.

00:09:39.810 --> 00:09:41.140
Besides, Lei En

00:09:41.190 --> 00:09:43.110
was kind-hearted.

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:45.560
You're wasting your time, Lei En!

00:09:46.590 --> 00:09:47.780
Don’t get attached to ingredients.

00:09:47.980 --> 00:09:48.640
But...

00:09:49.660 --> 00:09:51.800
Sometimes, he’d cook in tears.

00:09:54.380 --> 00:09:57.760
Lei En, you care about
those chickens, don't you?

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:00.900
I was concerned

00:10:01.290 --> 00:10:02.240
if he was too soft

00:10:02.290 --> 00:10:03.510
to be a chef.

00:10:06.910 --> 00:10:08.490
I must toughen myself up.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:11.360
I want to be a chef

00:10:11.610 --> 00:10:13.850
to make people happy, Meili.

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:14.740
I understand.

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:16.360
He decided to leave

00:10:16.410 --> 00:10:17.510
to hone his skills

00:10:18.000 --> 00:10:20.000
and started off his journey alone

00:10:20.200 --> 00:10:21.980
after talking to Chef Rouh and my father.

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:25.020
It’s been four years since then.

00:10:25.070 --> 00:10:26.650
We’ve heard nothing from him.

00:10:27.890 --> 00:10:29.830
I thought he’d never come back

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:32.460
and I wouldn’t see him again.

00:10:34.690 --> 00:10:35.510
That Lei En I know

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:37.670
would never go to the dark side.

00:10:38.270 --> 00:10:39.620
There must be a misunderstanding,

00:10:39.920 --> 00:10:40.840
right, Lei En?

00:10:41.140 --> 00:10:41.850
Don't touch me!

00:10:42.630 --> 00:10:43.320
Meili!

00:10:44.270 --> 00:10:44.930
Lei En!

00:10:46.330 --> 00:10:48.150
Tools mean the world to a chef.

00:10:50.140 --> 00:10:51.580
What happened to you, Lei En?

00:10:52.730 --> 00:10:54.190
You weren’t like this before.

00:10:55.650 --> 00:10:58.230
What changed you over the years?

00:10:59.950 --> 00:11:02.260
“Tools mean the world to a chef”.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:05.080
Cooking tools mean the world to chefs.

00:11:05.650 --> 00:11:07.110
Your shumai is crap

00:11:07.370 --> 00:11:09.530
without the steel staff.

00:11:09.970 --> 00:11:10.850
I knew it!

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:13.110
He grabbed my steel staff!

00:11:13.730 --> 00:11:16.220
Tell me where Ruoh and Zhou Yu are.

00:11:16.530 --> 00:11:17.430
Hey, what’s that attitude?

00:11:17.430 --> 00:11:19.310
They're both away.

00:11:20.230 --> 00:11:20.920
Lei En!

00:11:28.930 --> 00:11:30.380
What’s wrong with him?

00:11:38.390 --> 00:11:39.530
I’ll wait here.

00:11:40.020 --> 00:11:42.600
I need to see Ruoh.

00:11:42.860 --> 00:11:44.060
Where are your manners?

00:11:44.200 --> 00:11:45.770
I can’t believe

00:11:45.930 --> 00:11:47.000
he’s Lei En.

00:11:48.340 --> 00:11:49.010
Is he

00:11:49.330 --> 00:11:51.800
that special guest Chef Ruoh said?

00:11:52.550 --> 00:11:55.570
Lei En, what have you been through?

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.050
(Chūka Ichiban)

00:12:24.490 --> 00:12:25.370
Chefs.

00:12:33.120 --> 00:12:33.880
Chef Ruoh.

00:12:34.610 --> 00:12:35.270
Father.

00:12:36.370 --> 00:12:37.860
Is everything alright?

00:12:38.120 --> 00:12:39.310
Why the long face?

00:12:49.220 --> 00:12:50.260
Where were you?

00:12:50.710 --> 00:12:51.480
You are...?

00:12:52.640 --> 00:12:54.430
Welcome home, Lei En.

00:12:54.950 --> 00:12:55.940
I’ve had them

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:59.430
prepare buffalo dishes for you.

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:01.370
Let’s celebrate your return

00:13:01.420 --> 00:13:02.670
all night long!

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:04.130
No need.

00:13:05.480 --> 00:13:07.650
You look much tougher than before.

00:13:08.400 --> 00:13:10.410
How have you been, son?

00:13:10.850 --> 00:13:12.170
Skip the formalities.

00:13:14.580 --> 00:13:17.390
Do you remember your promise, Chef Ruoh?

00:13:18.370 --> 00:13:19.500
My promise?

00:13:19.910 --> 00:13:20.470
Yes.

00:13:21.770 --> 00:13:22.630
You’ve promised me

00:13:22.680 --> 00:13:24.440
the legendary cookware

00:13:24.990 --> 00:13:25.830
once I return,

00:13:26.650 --> 00:13:27.810
Chef Ruoh.

00:13:27.860 --> 00:13:28.760
Here I am and let me have it.

00:13:30.600 --> 00:13:31.770
The legendary cookware?

00:13:31.820 --> 00:13:32.960
What is that?

00:13:34.140 --> 00:13:35.750
The legendary cookware...

00:13:36.720 --> 00:13:38.370
You remember

00:13:38.830 --> 00:13:39.920
what you said that day, don’t you?

00:13:45.810 --> 00:13:46.590
Lei En,

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:48.150
tour around the country

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:50.650
and see new things.

00:13:50.700 --> 00:13:52.500
That’ll help you grow quickly.

00:13:52.980 --> 00:13:53.470
Yes!

00:13:53.740 --> 00:13:55.150
You’re more than capable

00:13:55.170 --> 00:13:56.140
of rising to a master chef

00:13:56.290 --> 00:13:58.570
qualified for

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.210
the legendary cookware

00:14:00.260 --> 00:14:01.400
once you return

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:04.020
to Guangzhou.

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:08.400
Thank you, Chef Ruoh!

00:14:14.570 --> 00:14:15.750
The legendary cookware

00:14:16.260 --> 00:14:17.370
is real!

00:14:18.060 --> 00:14:18.770
What?

00:14:18.820 --> 00:14:20.740
What is it anyway?

00:14:21.760 --> 00:14:22.720
There’s an old legend

00:14:22.930 --> 00:14:23.550
among chefs

00:14:23.590 --> 00:14:26.100
in China

00:14:27.700 --> 00:14:29.960
that some mysterious cooking tools

00:14:30.530 --> 00:14:31.330
are sealed

00:14:31.380 --> 00:14:33.870
somewhere in the country.

00:14:34.270 --> 00:14:36.100
It’s said the owner of those tools

00:14:36.440 --> 00:14:39.140
will gain magic power.

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:44.160
Guangzhou, the Capital of Food,

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.890
is the perfect place to store those tools

00:14:48.130 --> 00:14:51.240
and Chef Ruoh in the city

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:53.570
knows where they are.

00:14:54.250 --> 00:14:55.430
The legendary cookware

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:57.890
should go to me,

00:14:57.890 --> 00:14:59.040
or it’d be wasted.

00:14:59.570 --> 00:15:00.850
I’ve met your conditions.

00:15:01.750 --> 00:15:03.920
Give me the cookware, Chef Ruoh.

00:15:04.050 --> 00:15:05.260
Not so fast, punk!

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.870
Chef Ruoh, he was the one

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.520
who sneaked up on me

00:15:09.570 --> 00:15:10.500
and stole my steel staff.

00:15:10.980 --> 00:15:12.560
And he’s with Dark Cooking Society!

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.350
What?

00:15:13.730 --> 00:15:15.880
That tattoo on his left hand

00:15:16.180 --> 00:15:17.480
is solid proof.

00:15:18.720 --> 00:15:20.240
The legendary cookware

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:22.210
cannot fall into his hands,

00:15:22.520 --> 00:15:23.990
or there will be dire consequences!

00:15:24.350 --> 00:15:25.400
Don’t you agree, Chef Ruoh?

00:15:30.430 --> 00:15:32.090
Is that true, Lei En?

00:15:32.300 --> 00:15:33.050
If that’s the case,

00:15:33.130 --> 00:15:34.820
no way would we ever

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:35.830
give the cookware to you!

00:15:36.000 --> 00:15:36.450
Yes!

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:37.460
That's right!

00:15:37.510 --> 00:15:38.620
Chaos will rise

00:15:38.670 --> 00:15:40.030
if we do!

00:15:40.080 --> 00:15:41.480
Exactly!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.580
He can have it.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:48.150
You made this cut, right, Lei En?

00:15:51.460 --> 00:15:52.550
The juice is tightly locked

00:15:52.590 --> 00:15:53.800
in the meat

00:15:54.100 --> 00:15:54.940
which requires

00:15:54.990 --> 00:15:56.190
a fairly high level of knife skills,

00:15:57.190 --> 00:15:58.240
hence

00:15:58.470 --> 00:15:59.620
the qualification

00:15:59.670 --> 00:16:01.410
for the legendary cookware.

00:16:03.030 --> 00:16:04.840
That’s not right, Zhou Yu!

00:16:04.970 --> 00:16:06.660
We’ll be in trouble!

00:16:06.740 --> 00:16:07.900
Yes!

00:16:08.490 --> 00:16:09.670
I respect you as always, Zhou Yu.

00:16:10.040 --> 00:16:10.920
You know better than others.

00:16:11.250 --> 00:16:12.140
You can’t let him have it!

00:16:12.180 --> 00:16:12.980
Mr. Zhou,

00:16:13.030 --> 00:16:13.950
he’s a member of Dark Cooking Society!

00:16:14.000 --> 00:16:14.740
But

00:16:18.890 --> 00:16:20.070
as they said,

00:16:20.730 --> 00:16:21.620
if the cookware

00:16:21.670 --> 00:16:22.730
ends up in the wrong hands,

00:16:22.850 --> 00:16:25.080
our entire cooking industry
will be ruined.

00:16:25.470 --> 00:16:26.100
Indeed!

00:16:26.220 --> 00:16:27.910
We can’t let that happen!

00:16:28.050 --> 00:16:28.650
We can’t!

00:16:28.780 --> 00:16:30.000
I agree! He can’t have the cookware!

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:30.870
He should leave!

00:16:30.920 --> 00:16:31.870
Yes! Kick him out!

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:32.460
Let him go!

00:16:32.530 --> 00:16:33.310
Hold on!

00:16:33.760 --> 00:16:35.470
You must prove your skills

00:16:35.970 --> 00:16:37.220
in a duel

00:16:37.270 --> 00:16:39.000
at Daxian Temple first

00:16:39.580 --> 00:16:42.750
where the cookware is stored.

00:16:44.070 --> 00:16:44.960
The legendary cookware

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:45.850
has been there

00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:47.030
for hundreds of years,

00:16:47.560 --> 00:16:49.450
sealed off in the Treasure Hall

00:16:49.450 --> 00:16:51.900
and ownerless to this day.

00:16:53.940 --> 00:16:55.850
Before that, it changed hands

00:16:55.900 --> 00:16:57.570
from one master chef to another.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:59.160
Its magic power

00:16:59.180 --> 00:17:00.290
has attracted tons of chefs

00:17:00.740 --> 00:17:02.390
from Guangdong

00:17:02.440 --> 00:17:04.290
throughout history.

00:17:05.550 --> 00:17:07.140
To use it,

00:17:07.660 --> 00:17:08.460
one must excel

00:17:08.510 --> 00:17:09.590
at skills

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:10.830
and mind

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:11.920
in a way that no one else can.

00:17:14.220 --> 00:17:16.070
It’s time to show everyone

00:17:17.120 --> 00:17:18.160
if what you’ve learned
over the past four years

00:17:18.210 --> 00:17:19.830
can help you

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:22.020
win the legendary cookware, Lei En.

00:17:23.250 --> 00:17:24.530
Why should I?

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:25.440
I won’t do it.

00:17:27.270 --> 00:17:29.360
My original words were

00:17:29.920 --> 00:17:31.060
“I believe you’ll be more than capable

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:33.580
of rising to a master chef

00:17:33.810 --> 00:17:35.150
qualified for the legendary cookware

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.430
once you return

00:17:36.480 --> 00:17:39.300
to Guangzhou”.

00:17:43.330 --> 00:17:45.230
Show me

00:17:45.610 --> 00:17:47.660
all you’ve got.

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.990
All... all he’s got?

00:17:50.810 --> 00:17:52.140
There’s more

00:17:52.180 --> 00:17:54.080
than Roaring Bull Green Dragon Chop?

00:17:55.670 --> 00:17:57.850
I heard your signature skill

00:17:58.170 --> 00:17:59.550
is to wield seven knives together,

00:17:59.550 --> 00:18:01.980
known as Seven-Star Knives,

00:18:05.910 --> 00:18:06.530
Lei En.

00:18:08.640 --> 00:18:10.630
Fine. I’ll do it for fun.

00:18:10.680 --> 00:18:12.170
I’m in.

00:18:12.510 --> 00:18:15.070
Who am I battling, though?

00:18:15.160 --> 00:18:16.340
Is it you, Zhou Yu?

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:18.610
You arrogant brat! Be polite!

00:18:18.610 --> 00:18:19.710
If not you,

00:18:20.270 --> 00:18:21.320
who else is it?

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:22.440
Shut up!

00:18:30.040 --> 00:18:31.810
Mao, you’re up.

00:18:32.240 --> 00:18:32.970
Mao!

00:18:33.270 --> 00:18:34.080
Mao!

00:18:34.800 --> 00:18:35.290
Mao,

00:18:35.690 --> 00:18:37.760
show him what you got!

00:18:37.870 --> 00:18:38.760
Crush him!

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.230
It’s too far.

00:19:00.280 --> 00:19:00.820
How could you!

00:19:00.880 --> 00:19:03.260
Are you crazy? That’s Mao’s dish!

00:19:03.930 --> 00:19:04.870
You call that a dish?

00:19:06.700 --> 00:19:08.410
Are you feeling so good about yourself

00:19:08.460 --> 00:19:09.630
because you beat that loser Li Yan?

00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.350
You call him a loser?

00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:13.260
That chicken

00:19:13.300 --> 00:19:15.300
clung on to the past

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:17.950
while I’ve left it way behind me.

00:19:19.060 --> 00:19:20.260
Don’t call him that.

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:25.460
Zhou Yu,

00:19:26.290 --> 00:19:29.090
have you tried a fall with that boy?

00:19:29.420 --> 00:19:30.250
No.

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:32.700
He can truly make a difference.

00:19:33.720 --> 00:19:35.500
You don’t know where his limit is

00:19:35.920 --> 00:19:38.370
when you're in the same kitchen with him.

00:19:39.050 --> 00:19:42.250
He and you hold the future

00:19:42.300 --> 00:19:43.760
of cooking in China,

00:19:44.630 --> 00:19:46.680
thus posing a threat
to Dark Cooking Society.

00:19:49.500 --> 00:19:51.150
Take care, Zhou Yu.

00:20:00.710 --> 00:20:02.990
Li Yan!

00:20:06.550 --> 00:20:08.750
Li Yan, I swear to you

00:20:09.460 --> 00:20:10.740
that I’ll make Mao

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.820
the best chef in China!

00:20:13.390 --> 00:20:14.490
I give you my word

00:20:15.190 --> 00:20:17.280
that I’ll destroy

00:20:17.390 --> 00:20:18.670
whoever comes from Dark Cooking Society!

00:20:26.710 --> 00:20:27.260
Mao.

00:20:27.920 --> 00:20:28.500
Yes.

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:31.730
Do your best.

00:20:37.300 --> 00:20:38.000
I will.

00:20:39.750 --> 00:20:41.280
I understand, Zhou Yu.

00:20:41.780 --> 00:20:43.320
Like he could get any better.

00:20:45.300 --> 00:20:47.970
Sir, I know I made a reckless move

00:20:48.520 --> 00:20:51.170
but it must be done.

00:20:58.030 --> 00:20:58.940
You did the right thing.

00:20:59.250 --> 00:21:01.370
I’ll gather

00:21:01.420 --> 00:21:02.790
all the elders in Guangzhou.

00:21:03.400 --> 00:21:05.240
Yes. Thank you.

00:21:06.290 --> 00:21:07.320
Listen up, Lei En

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:08.620
and Mao,

00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:10.490
you’ll have a Knife Skills Competition

00:21:11.050 --> 00:21:12.710
at Daxian Temple

00:21:13.000 --> 00:21:15.780
in two days.

00:23:15.019 --> 00:23:17.020
Preview of the next episode

00:23:17.453 --> 00:23:21.482
It's finally time to compete with the Dark Cooking Society
for the Legendary Cooking Utensils.

00:23:21.482 --> 00:23:24.569
Lei En's skill of manipulating
the seven knives like a miracle

00:23:24.569 --> 00:23:26.946
was terrifyingly well-honed.

00:23:27.447 --> 00:23:29.282
Next episode, Chūka Ichiban!

00:23:29.407 --> 00:23:30.951
Sharpness of Evil!

00:23:30.951 --> 00:23:32.785
Demonic Seven-Star Knives!

00:23:32.827 --> 00:23:34.579
It will definitely be interesting!
